{"id": "ru-adbe01160e93.de", "jokeId": "ru-adbe01160e93", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line in the theater variant of the hall with an audience crowd. The sprawled 'young man' is paren in the stalls at center; the polite couple, the administrator with a badge and the policeman each walk up in turn. Militiaman became a policeman; 'Genosse' keeps the Soviet flavour.", "title": "Vom Balkon", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "paren", "nachalnik", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife", "paren": "everyman", "nachalnik": "bureaucrat", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Theater. Die Zuschauer nehmen ihre Plätze ein.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Im Parkett sitzt breit hingefläzt ein Mann: die Füße auf den vorderen Sitzen, die Arme auf den Nachbarsitzen, den Kopf zurückgeworfen, die Zunge heraus.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Leute kommen zu ihm und sagen:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Entschuldigen Sie, unsere Plätze sind etwas weiter. Würden Sie uns bitte durchlassen?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Mann, null Reaktion. Sie wieder:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Junger Mann, Sie hindern uns am Durchgehen. Wenn Sie die Füße nicht wegnehmen, müssen wir den Administrator rufen.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Null Emotionen. Der Administrator kommt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Genosse, nehmen Sie die Füße weg, Sie hindern die Leute daran, zu ihren Plätzen zu gehen!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Keine Antwort.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Junger Mann! Sie verstoßen gegen die Verhaltensregeln an einem öffentlichen Ort! Wenn Sie die Füße nicht wegnehmen, rufe ich einen Polizisten!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Polizist kommt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Also so, Füße weg!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Mann schweigt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Bist du völlig übergeschnappt? Ich hab gesagt, Füße weg!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Schweigen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Hörst du mich nicht, oder was? Wo kommst du denn her?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Da sagt der Mann, kaum die Lippen bewegend:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Vom Balkon...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "theater", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "paren", "nachalnik", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife", "paren": "everyman", "nachalnik": "bureaucrat", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["bow-tie"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["earrings"]}, "nachalnik": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "audience", "size": "many", "at": "front"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "from": "off-left", "to": "stage-left"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "from": "off-right", "to": "stage-right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-right", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l17"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l18"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-e4f1302c8d71.ru", "jokeId": "ru-e4f1302c8d71", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept. A challenge at a banquet: the indignant officer and the hussar lieutenant in the bar's party variant, guests gasp at the challenge.", "title": "Дуэль", "location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "officer", "sluzhivy": "rzhevsky"}, "lines": [{"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Поручик, вы трус и подлец. Я вызываю вас на дуэль!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Я не приду.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Почему?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Потому что я трус и подлец.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "place": "party", "cast": ["sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "officer", "sluzhivy": "rzhevsky"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": {"add": ["mustache"]}, "sluzhivy": {"add": ["mustache-curled"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "gasp"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-e4f1302c8d71.en", "jokeId": "ru-e4f1302c8d71", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'Поручик' is simply 'Lieutenant'. Banquet in the bar's party variant, guests gasp at the challenge.", "title": "The Duel", "location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "officer", "sluzhivy": "rzhevsky"}, "lines": [{"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Lieutenant, you are a coward and a scoundrel. I challenge you to a duel!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "I won't come.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Why?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Because I am a coward and a scoundrel.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "place": "party", "cast": ["sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "officer", "sluzhivy": "rzhevsky"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": {"add": ["mustache"]}, "sluzhivy": {"add": ["mustache-curled"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "gasp"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-e4f1302c8d71.de", "jokeId": "ru-e4f1302c8d71", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'Поручик' is 'Herr Leutnant'. Banquet in the bar's party variant, guests gasp at the challenge.", "title": "Das Duell", "location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "officer", "sluzhivy": "rzhevsky"}, "lines": [{"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Herr Leutnant, Sie sind ein Feigling und ein Schuft. Ich fordere Sie zum Duell!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Ich komme nicht.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "text": "Warum?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Weil ich ein Feigling und ein Schuft bin.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "place": "party", "cast": ["sluzhivy-ryadovoy", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "officer", "sluzhivy": "rzhevsky"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy-ryadovoy": {"add": ["mustache"]}, "sluzhivy": {"add": ["mustache-curled"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "guests", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "gasp"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.ru", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept; 'сказал бригадир' trimmed, the screen shows who speaks. The 'corpse' is the officer in a dark suit with the coffin standing beside him; the young gravedigger with a shovel, the mourners are a crowd pushed away. The nailing is the payoff, so the narrator closes with it.", "title": "Контрольное захоронение", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "construction-worker", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "На кладбище во время похорон бригадир гробовщиков видит, что у покойника из нагрудного кармана пиджака торчит пятидесятирублёвая купюра.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Он тут же просит одного из своей бригады под любым предлогом оттеснить людей от гроба.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Когда это было сделано, и он потянулся к купюре, покойник вдруг хватает его за руку и кричит:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Налоговая полиция! Контрольное захоронение!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "У тебя своя работа, а у меня своя.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "И забил в крышку гроба гвозди.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "construction-worker", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"remove": ["police-cap"], "add": ["tie"], "clothes": "#2b2b30"}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "coffin", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "shovel", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.en", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; fifty roubles became a fifty-dollar bill, the cry follows adaptNote. The 'corpse' is the officer in a dark suit beside the coffin; the nailing is the payoff, so the narrator closes with it.", "title": "The Sting Burial", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "construction-worker", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "At a cemetery, during a funeral, the foreman of the gravediggers sees a fifty-dollar bill sticking out of the breast pocket of the dead man's jacket.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He immediately asks one of his crew to push the people away from the coffin on any pretext.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "When that's done and he reaches for the bill, the dead man suddenly grabs his hand and shouts:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Tax police! Sting burial!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "You've got your job, and I've got mine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "And he hammered nails into the coffin lid.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "construction-worker", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"remove": ["police-cap"], "add": ["tie"], "clothes": "#2b2b30"}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "coffin", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "shovel", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.de", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; fifty roubles became a fifty-euro note, the cry follows adaptNote. The 'corpse' is the officer in a dark suit beside the coffin; the nailing is the payoff, so the narrator closes with it.", "title": "Die Testbeerdigung", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "construction-worker", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Auf dem Friedhof, während einer Beerdigung, sieht der Vorarbeiter der Totengräber, dass dem Toten ein Fünfzig-Euro-Schein aus der Brusttasche des Jacketts ragt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Sofort bittet er einen aus seiner Truppe, die Leute unter irgendeinem Vorwand vom Sarg wegzudrängen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Als das erledigt ist und er nach dem Schein greift, packt ihn der Tote plötzlich an der Hand und schreit:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Steuerfahndung! Testbeerdigung!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Du hast deine Arbeit, und ich hab meine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Und er schlug Nägel in den Sargdeckel.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "construction-worker", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"remove": ["police-cap"], "add": ["tie"], "clothes": "#2b2b30"}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "coffin", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "shovel", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe.ru", "jokeId": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept, 'А он им' trimmed. The drunk husband (red nose, bottle) crawls in at the door of the flat; the wife in curlers and two kids run out of the room.", "title": "Без папки", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "zhena": "wife", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Пьяный муж возвращается домой ползком в три часа ночи.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "В прихожей падает, задевает вешалку, раздаётся страшный грохот, и всё рушится: тазы, лыжи, велосипед...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Из комнаты в ужасе выбегают жена и двое детей.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ну что, не спится без папки-то?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "zhena": "wife", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "from": "off-right", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka-drug", "from": "off-right", "to": "table"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devochka", "from": "off-right", "to": "tv"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe.en", "jokeId": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line. The drunk husband (red nose, bottle) crawls in at the door; the wife in curlers and two kids run out of the room.", "title": "Can't Sleep Without Daddy", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "zhena": "wife", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A drunk husband crawls home at three in the morning.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "In the hallway he falls, knocks over the coat rack, there's a terrible crash and everything comes down: basins, skis, a bicycle...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "His wife and two kids run out of the room in horror.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Well, what, can't sleep without your daddy?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "zhena": "wife", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "from": "off-right", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka-drug", "from": "off-right", "to": "table"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devochka", "from": "off-right", "to": "tv"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe.de", "jokeId": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line. The drunk husband (red nose, bottle) crawls in at the door; the wife in curlers and two kids run out of the room.", "title": "Ohne Papi", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "zhena": "wife", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein betrunkener Ehemann kriecht um drei Uhr nachts nach Hause.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Im Flur fällt er hin, reißt die Garderobe um, es gibt ein furchtbares Getöse, und alles kracht herunter: Wannen, Skier, ein Fahrrad...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Entsetzt stürzen die Frau und die zwei Kinder aus dem Zimmer.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Na, was ist, könnt ihr ohne Papi nicht schlafen?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena", "vovochka-drug", "devochka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "zhena": "wife", "vovochka-drug": "child", "devochka": "child"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "from": "off-right", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "vovochka-drug", "from": "off-right", "to": "table"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devochka", "from": "off-right", "to": "tv"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-4b1671537586.ru", "jokeId": "ru-4b1671537586", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept, numbers as words. The bathroom variant has the toilet: the plumber walks in to it with a wrench, then comes over to the doctor to name the price.", "title": "Нейрохирург", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["doktor", "barmen"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "barmen": "plumber"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "У врача дома засорился унитаз.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Вызвали водопроводчика.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Водопроводчик пришёл, пару раз где-то стукнул молотком, заменил прокладку, закрутил гайку.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Готово, всё работает. С вас пятьсот рублей.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Как пятьсот рублей? За пять минут работы?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Я нейрохирург, я двенадцать лет учился специальности, но мне за пять минут работы пятьсот рублей не платят.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Так это нормально. Когда я нейрохирургом был, мне тоже так не платили.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "place": "bathroom", "cast": ["doktor", "barmen"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "barmen": "plumber"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "from": "off-right", "to": "toilet"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-4b1671537586.en", "jokeId": "ru-4b1671537586", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; five hundred roubles became two hundred dollars, the same high price for five minutes. The plumber works at the toilet in the bathroom variant.", "title": "The Neurosurgeon", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["doktor", "barmen"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "barmen": "plumber"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A doctor's toilet got clogged at home.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "They called a plumber.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The plumber came, tapped something with a hammer a couple of times, replaced a gasket, tightened a nut.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Done, everything works. That'll be two hundred dollars.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "What do you mean, two hundred dollars? For five minutes of work?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "I'm a neurosurgeon, I studied my specialty for twelve years, and nobody pays me two hundred dollars for five minutes of work.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Well, that's normal. When I was a neurosurgeon, they didn't pay me that either.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "place": "bathroom", "cast": ["doktor", "barmen"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "barmen": "plumber"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "from": "off-right", "to": "toilet"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-4b1671537586.de", "jokeId": "ru-4b1671537586", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; five hundred roubles became two hundred euros, the same high price for five minutes. The plumber works at the toilet in the bathroom variant.", "title": "Der Neurochirurg", "location": "spalnya", "cast": ["doktor", "barmen"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "barmen": "plumber"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Bei einem Arzt zu Hause ist die Toilette verstopft.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Man rief einen Klempner.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Klempner kam, klopfte ein paar Mal irgendwo mit dem Hammer, wechselte eine Dichtung, zog eine Mutter fest.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Fertig, alles funktioniert. Das macht zweihundert Euro.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Wie, zweihundert Euro? Für fünf Minuten Arbeit?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ich bin Neurochirurg, ich habe zwölf Jahre lang mein Fach studiert, aber mir zahlt keiner für fünf Minuten Arbeit zweihundert Euro.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Das ist doch normal. Als ich Neurochirurg war, hat man mir das auch nicht gezahlt.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "spalnya", "place": "bathroom", "cast": ["doktor", "barmen"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor", "barmen": "plumber"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "from": "off-right", "to": "toilet"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-d252ac6b344f.ru", "jokeId": "ru-d252ac6b344f", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept; the orders became Stirlitz's own lines, 'извинился/огорчённо сказал бармен' shown by emotion, the thought is spoken. The contact sits drunk on the far stool with a bottle, so the inference is visible.", "title": "Связной", "location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "barmen", "muzhik"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "stirlitz", "barmen": "bartender", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Штирлиц пришёл на встречу со связным в знакомый бар.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Сто грамм водки.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Водка у нас кончилась ещё два дня назад.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Ну, тогда сто грамм коньячку.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Коньячок у нас кончился вчера.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Ну, а пиво-то есть?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Увы, закончилось сегодня утром.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Значит, связной уже здесь.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "barmen", "muzhik"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "stirlitz", "barmen": "bartender", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "stool-right"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-d252ac6b344f.en", "jokeId": "ru-d252ac6b344f", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Stirlitz is introduced as a Soviet spy per adaptNote, a hundred grams became a double. The drunk contact sits on the far stool with a bottle.", "title": "The Contact", "location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "barmen", "muzhik"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "stirlitz", "barmen": "bartender", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Stirlitz, the Soviet spy, came to a familiar bar to meet his contact.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "A double vodka.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "We ran out of vodka two days ago.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Well, then a double cognac.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "We ran out of cognac yesterday.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Well, do you at least have beer?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Sorry, that ran out this morning.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "So my contact is already here.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "barmen", "muzhik"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "stirlitz", "barmen": "bartender", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "stool-right"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-d252ac6b344f.de", "jokeId": "ru-d252ac6b344f", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Stirlitz is introduced as a Soviet spy per adaptNote, a hundred grams became a double. The drunk contact sits on the far stool with a bottle.", "title": "Der Verbindungsmann", "location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "barmen", "muzhik"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "stirlitz", "barmen": "bartender", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Der sowjetische Spion Stirlitz kam in eine bekannte Bar, um seinen Verbindungsmann zu treffen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Einen doppelten Wodka.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Der Wodka ist uns schon vor zwei Tagen ausgegangen.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Na, dann einen doppelten Cognac.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Der Cognac ist uns gestern ausgegangen.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Na, und Bier gibt's wenigstens?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Leider, das ist heute Morgen ausgegangen.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Also ist mein Verbindungsmann schon da.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "bar", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "barmen", "muzhik"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "stirlitz", "barmen": "bartender", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "barmen", "to": "counter"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "stool-right"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-5d03cb706464.ru", "jokeId": "ru-5d03cb706464", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept; 'напустилась на него жена' shown by her angry line, 'на хрен' softened. Home, then the forest where the man and the cat disappear, then home again: the cat walks in first, the scruffy man right behind it.", "title": "Кот", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik", "kot"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "У одного мужика был кот.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "И то ли старый котяра уже стал, то ли сметану спёр, но жена мужика приказала отнести его далеко в лес и оставить там на произвол судьбы.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Делать нечего, понёс мужик кота в лес.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "И сам пропал.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "День его нет, два нет, на третий день появляется дома кот.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "И тут же мужик следом, грязный, злой и голодный.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ну ты чего, урод, отнёс кота в лес?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ага, отнёс, блин! И если бы за ним следом не пошёл, заблудился бы нафиг...", "uncensored": "Ага, отнёс, блин! И если бы за ним следом не пошёл, заблудился бы на хрен...", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik", "kot"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "kot", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-right"}]}, {"location": "derevnya", "place": "forest", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["kot", "muzhik"], "roles": {"kot": "cat", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["muzhik", "kot", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "table"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "kot", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-5d03cb706464.en", "jokeId": "ru-5d03cb706464", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'блин' is 'dammit', 'на хрен' is 'as hell', clean enough without a separate version. Home, the forest, then home again: the cat walks in first, the scruffy man right behind it.", "title": "The Cat", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik", "kot"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A man had a cat.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Maybe the tomcat had just got too old, maybe he'd stolen the sour cream, but the man's wife ordered him to carry it far into the forest and leave it there to its fate.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Nothing to be done, the man carried the cat into the forest.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "And vanished himself.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "One day he's gone, two days gone, on the third day the cat shows up at home.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "And right behind it, the man: dirty, angry and hungry.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Well, you moron, did you take the cat to the forest?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Yeah, I took it, dammit! And if I hadn't followed it, I'd have gotten lost as hell...", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik", "kot"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "kot", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-right"}]}, {"location": "derevnya", "place": "forest", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["kot", "muzhik"], "roles": {"kot": "cat", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["muzhik", "kot", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "table"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "kot", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-5d03cb706464.de", "jokeId": "ru-5d03cb706464", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the cat is a Kater to match the male puppet, 'блин' is 'Mist', 'на хрен' is 'verdammt noch mal'. Home, the forest, then home again: the cat walks in first, the scruffy man right behind it.", "title": "Der Kater", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik", "kot"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Mann hatte einen Kater.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ob der Kater schon zu alt geworden war oder ob er die saure Sahne geklaut hatte, jedenfalls befahl die Frau des Mannes, ihn weit in den Wald zu tragen und dort seinem Schicksal zu überlassen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Nichts zu machen, der Mann trug den Kater in den Wald.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Und verschwand selbst.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Einen Tag ist er weg, zwei Tage weg, am dritten Tag taucht zu Hause der Kater auf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Und gleich hinter ihm der Mann: dreckig, wütend und hungrig.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Na, du Trottel, hast du den Kater in den Wald gebracht?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ja, hab ich, Mist! Und wenn ich ihm nicht hinterhergelaufen wäre, hätte ich mich verdammt noch mal verlaufen...", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "muzhik", "kot"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "move", "who": "kot", "to": "off-right"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "off-right"}]}, {"location": "derevnya", "place": "forest", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["kot", "muzhik"], "roles": {"kot": "cat", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["muzhik", "kot", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "kot": "cat", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "table"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "kot", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "from": "off-left", "to": "door"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-f0ee36c1c849.ru", "jokeId": "ru-f0ee36c1c849", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept, punctuation cleaned for speech; 'Мужской голос из зала' trimmed, the man is seen in the aisle. The assembly hall has the lectern, the audience is a crowd.", "title": "Кокосы в раю", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik", "devushka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "devushka": "woman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Идёт слёт феминистских организаций. На трибуне очередная баба-оратор яростно вещает:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Что бы делали эти мужики сейчас без женщин?! Ну вот что бы они без нас делали?!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "А?! Я вас спрашиваю!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Что, что?! Жрали бы себе кокосы в раю!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik", "devushka"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "devushka": "woman"}, "crowd": {"who": "audience", "size": "many", "at": "front"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "aisle"}, {"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "lectern"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}]}
